       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. TEST-NO-SQL.

       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-AT.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER. IBM-AT.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.

           01 WS-NAME    PIC X(20) VALUE 'COBOL WORLD'.
           01 WS-COUNT   PIC 9(4)  VALUE 0.
           01 WS-RESULT  PIC 9(8)  VALUE 0.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.

       000-MAIN.
           DISPLAY 'NO-SQL PASSTHROUGH TEST'.
           DISPLAY 'NAME: ' WS-NAME.

           PERFORM 100-COMPUTE 5 TIMES.

           DISPLAY 'FINAL COUNT: ' WS-COUNT.
           DISPLAY 'FINAL RESULT: ' WS-RESULT.

           STOP RUN.

       100-COMPUTE.
           ADD 1 TO WS-COUNT.
           COMPUTE WS-RESULT = WS-COUNT * WS-COUNT.
           DISPLAY 'ITERATION ' WS-COUNT ' RESULT ' WS-RESULT.
